  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "おはよう、転校生くん。昨夜は、よく眠れた？"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 8,
    "dress": "miko",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "miko_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 498
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "ふふ。眠気覚ましにお散歩してるのかな。朝はぐっと冷えこむし、もうちょっと厚着をしたほうがいいよ"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 8,
    "dress": "miko",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "miko_expression/sad1",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 498
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "それに。君にとっては知らない土地なんだし、独りで出歩いたら迷子になっちゃうよ。君がいなくなったら哀しむひともおおいんだから、気をつけてね"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 8,
    "dress": "miko",
    "pose": "2",
    "expression": "miko_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 498
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "play_emotion_effect",
    "id": "center",
    "effect": "confused",
    "position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "play_voice",
    "asset_code": "web:voice/character/8/emo_laugh-2.wav"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "ふふ。朝から、お説教みたいなことを言ってごめんね。駄目だなぁ、お小言が癖になってるのかも"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 8,
    "dress": "miko",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": null,
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 498
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "細かいところが気になって、あれこれ口出しをしちゃう……。わたし、いつも失敗ばかりの『かわいい妹』のお姉ちゃんだからね"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 8,
    "dress": "miko",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "miko_expression/sad1",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 498
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "口うるさいと、みんなに嫌われちゃうかな……。ん？　どうしたの、何でわたしをじっと見ているの？"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 8,
    "dress": "miko",
    "pose": "2",
    "expression": "miko_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 498
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "play_emotion_effect",
    "id": "center",
    "effect": "question",
    "position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "play_voice",
    "asset_code": "web:voice/character/8/emo_puzzle-1.wav"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "え？　『なるほど。これがお姉ちゃんか』って？　どういうことだろう、ちょっと難しいな……う～ん？"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 8,
    "dress": "miko",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": null,
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 498
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "そっか。よくわからないけど、いま黒森さんが転校生くんの『お姉ちゃん』をやってるんだね。でも苦労してるみたいだから、アドバイスをしてあげたいのかな"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 8,
    "dress": "miko",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "miko_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 498
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "play_voice",
    "asset_code": "web:voice/character/8/emo_laugh-2.wav"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "ふふ。良かったら、わたしが『お姉ちゃん』のお手本を見せてあげて……って？　どうだろうなぁ、ひとに教わることでもないと思うけど♪"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 8,
    "dress": "miko",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "miko_expression/serious",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 498
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "わたしは、あくまで『いちかのお姉ちゃん』だから。『転校生くんのお姉ちゃん』のやりかたは、やっぱりご本人かそれをよく知る君にしかわからないよ"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 8,
    "dress": "miko",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "miko_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 498
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "そう考えると、演劇部のみんなはすごいよね。いろんな役柄を演じるんだもん、わたしもよく練習風景とか舞台とか見せてもらってるけど……。毎回、感動しちゃう"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 8,
    "dress": "miko",
    "pose": "2",
    "expression": "miko_expression/serious",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 498
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "どんな気分なんだろう……。生まれや育ちどころか、性別や種族もちがったりするんでしょう。自分とはちがう目で見て、耳で聞いて、肌で感じて生きていくの"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 8,
    "dress": "miko",
    "pose": "2",
    "expression": "miko_expression/sad1",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 498
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "それって、どんな感じなんだろう。わたしは神樹神社の跡継ぎの巫女で、『生き神』って呼ばれて……。ひとに当て嵌められた枠のなかで、いつも生きているから"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "あの子たちの、自分の輪郭なんか超越して自由奔放に生きている姿が、眩しく見える……。昔から、ずうっと羨ましいと思ってた気がするよ"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 8,
    "dress": "miko",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "miko_expression/embarrassed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 498
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "play_emotion_effect",
    "id": "center",
    "effect": "confused",
    "position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "play_voice",
    "asset_code": "web:voice/character/8/habit-7.wav"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "ふふ。ごめんね。寝惚けてるのかなぁ、ふわふわしたことを言っちゃった"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 8,
    "dress": "miko",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": null,
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 498
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "……うん。わたしは見てのとおり、お掃除をしてるんだ"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "今この神社は管理者が不在でね、わたしはその代理として一時的に派遣されてきたから。神樹神社の名代として、この分社をしっかり維持する責任があるんだ"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 8,
    "dress": "miko",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "miko_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 498
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "play_voice",
    "asset_code": "web:voice/character/8/emo_laugh-2.wav"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "もともと早朝、うちの境内をお掃除をするのが日課だしね。いつもと同じことを、いつもと同じ時間にすると落ちつくんだ"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 8,
    "dress": "miko",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "miko_expression/serious",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 498
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "初詣の時期でけっこうごみが散らかってたりするし、掃き清める作業は必要だしね。みんなに新年を、一日の始まりを、穢れのない空気のなかで迎えてほしいから"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "だから年末には大掃除をするし、わたしは竹箒で地道に掃き掃除をするんだ"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 8,
    "dress": "miko",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "miko_expression/surprise1",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 498
