    "position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 498
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "ん？　手伝ってくれるの、転校生くん？"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 8,
    "dress": "miko",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "miko_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 498
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "play_voice",
    "asset_code": "web:voice/character/8/habit-10.wav"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "ありがとう。この神社、ずっと管理するひとがいなくてあちこち寂れて汚れてるから……。ひとりじゃ手が回らなくて、だいぶ苦労してたんだ"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 8,
    "dress": "miko",
    "pose": "2",
    "expression": "miko_expression/sad1",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 10,
      "y": 498
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "はじめ",
    "text": "だから助かるけど、本当にいいの？　君はいつも人助けをしているけど、『無理だな』とか『つらいな』って思ったら一休みするか相談してね"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 8,
